#: ../../source/api/tree/heap.rst:12 9f496f9286594258a8e40782771d7ecb
msgid ""
"This module provides heap data structures for efficient priority queue "
"operations. Heaps maintain a complete binary tree where each parent is "
"less than (min-heap) or greater than (max-heap) its children, enabling "
"O(1) access to the minimum or maximum element and O(log n) insertions and"
" deletions."
msgstr ""

